{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"希伯来书","commonName":"希伯来书","title":"希伯来书","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"2c6f2c6885c0d90704c9582e6fe7720be42b3b4d3b820007897ccb662d08a6fa","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":303},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["凡从人间挑选的大祭司，是奉派替人办理属 神的事，为要献上礼物和赎罪祭",{"noteId":4},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他能体谅那愚蒙的和失迷的人，因为他自己也是被软弱所困。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["故此，他理当为百姓和自己献祭赎罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["这大祭司的尊荣，没有人自取。惟要蒙 神所召，像亚伦一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["如此，基督也不是自取荣耀作大祭司，乃是在乎向他说「你是我的儿子，我今日生你」的那一位；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["就如经上又有一处说：「你是照着麦基洗德的等次永远为祭司。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["基督在肉体的时候，既大声哀哭，流泪祷告，恳求那能救他免死的主，就因他的虔诚蒙了应允。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他虽然为儿子，还是因所受的苦难学了顺从。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他既得以完全，就为凡顺从他的人成了永远得救的根源，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["并蒙 神照着麦基洗德的等次称他为大祭司。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["警戒叛道的人"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["论到麦基洗德，我们有好些话，并且难以解明，因为你们听不进去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["看你们学习的工夫，本该作师傅，谁知还得有人将 神圣言小学的开端另教导你们，并且成了那必须吃奶、不能吃干粮的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["凡只能吃奶的都不熟练仁义的道理，因为他是婴孩；"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["惟独长大成人的才能吃干粮；他们的心窍习练得通达，就能分辨好歹了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"或译：要为罪献上礼物和祭物","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HEB/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}